---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---

<DocLayout title="Getting Started" description="Install NeNe Corpus on shared hosting (Tier A) or Docker/VPS (Tier B).">
  <h1>Getting Started</h1>
  <p>NeNe Corpus supports two deployment modes sharing the same codebase.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th></th>
        <th>Tier A</th>
        <th>Tier B</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Target</strong></td>
        <td>Shared hosting (Sakura, Heteml…)</td>
        <td>Docker / VPS / cloud</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Install</strong></td>
        <td>Web installer via browser</td>
        <td><code>docker compose up</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>CLI required</strong></td>
        <td>No</td>
        <td>Yes</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Recommended for</strong></td>
        <td>Non-technical operators</td>
        <td>Developers</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
  <p>Both tiers require:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>PHP 8.2+</strong> with PDO, PDO_MySQL, mbstring, json, fileinfo extensions</li>
    <li><strong>MySQL 8.0+</strong> (or MariaDB 10.5+)</li>
    <li>An <strong>Anthropic API key</strong> (for Claude AI chat)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Choose your deployment</h2>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem;">
    <a href="/docs/getting-started/tier-a"
      style="flex:1;min-width:200px;display:block;padding:1rem 1.25rem;border-radius:0.75rem;
      border:1px solid var(--color-border);text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
      <strong>Tier A — Shared Hosting</strong><br />
      <span style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-fg-muted);">ZIP download → FTP → Web installer</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/getting-started/tier-b"
      style="flex:1;min-width:200px;display:block;padding:1rem 1.25rem;border-radius:0.75rem;
      border:1px solid var(--color-border);text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
      <strong>Tier B — Docker / VPS</strong><br />
      <span style="font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-fg-muted);">Clone → .env → docker compose up</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</DocLayout>
